1
00:00:00,350 --> 00:00:02,270
Opening and saving a project.

2
00:00:03,170 --> 00:00:09,165
To open a file, click Open Project, on the start screen or in the left bar, and choose its format.

3
00:00:10,065 --> 00:00:16,331
The IDM Project format is the app's own project file.

4
00:00:16,331 --> 00:00:22,124
idmXML 2.0 is the exchange format of ISO 29481-3.

5
00:00:22,124 --> 00:00:29,691
You can also open idmXML 1.0, IDS, BPMN and reviewed HTML files.

6
00:00:30,591 --> 00:00:33,471
To save, click Save and Export in the left bar.

7
00:00:34,371 --> 00:00:37,787
Save the IDM Project file to keep working on it later.

8
00:00:37,787 --> 00:00:41,646
It keeps everything, including the layout of the process map.

9
00:00:42,546 --> 00:00:50,694
Export idmXML 2.0 to exchange the IDM with other tools, following ISO 29481-3.

10
00:00:50,694 --> 00:00:57,693
Export an HTML document to share a readable version with reviewers.

